comments.body:
The libraries was already included explicit, but the link_setting was missing.  

```
      "link_settings": {
        	"libraries": [
        		"-Wl,-rpath,@loader_path/../../lib/DronecodeSDK/install/lib"
        	],
        },
```

Now the example run as expected!

